A||||28||Fiero_24||Superchargers?||||5||
Z||000000||Fiero_24||07-20-2001||05:55 PM||||I am sure this subject has been touched many times, but I need some help.  I am trying to find a supercharger for a 2.8.  I tried looking through the old Pennocks archives, but came up with nothing solid on 2.8 superchargers.  I was told that there was a company that made one that would replace ther A/C compressor.  Does anyone know anything about this?<P>Craig<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||5
