Z||000002||Rogue_Ant||07-20-2001||07:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>I am trying to find a supercharger for a 2.8<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Why not use a TurboCharger?  You can make just as much boost from it as you can a SuperCharger, thus as much horsepower.  Actually you can make more horsepower since the turbo doesn't leach power to make boost as a supercharger does.<P>Rogue<BR>||||reg||1
